WEBVTT

00:04:59.295 --> 00:05:01.964
we have to design a rule or a maxim

00:05:02.006 --> 00:05:03.883
that we could will to be universal.

00:05:03.924 --> 00:05:05.301
Meaning, we have to imagine,

00:05:05.301 --> 00:05:07.678
what if everyone did
what we're about to do,

00:05:07.678 --> 00:05:09.180
what would happen to the world?

00:05:09.221 --> 00:05:11.390
Would it be OK or would it get
all screwed up?

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.976
So the maxim I'm designing here
is something like,

00:05:14.018 --> 00:05:17.438
anytime two people
are in any kind of negotiation,

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:20.274
one of them can drag into the negotiation

00:05:20.316 --> 00:05:23.069
an entirely unrelated global calamity

00:05:23.069 --> 00:05:24.070
(Laughter)

00:05:24.111 --> 00:05:25.321
and tell the other person

00:05:25.363 --> 00:05:27.990
that they shouldn't care
about whatever they care about,

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.076
because they should care
about that instead.